1
00:00:30,240 --> 00:00:31,610
I've got my eye on her.

2
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:33,010
Now get lost!

3
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:13,500
♪Winds rise. Youth fades. Joy and sorrow turn to nothing♪

4
00:01:15,540 --> 00:01:21,500
♪Blossoms fade away. This fleeting life is but a dream♪

5
00:01:22,540 --> 00:01:26,780
♪Desire blinds my eyes♪

6
00:01:30,460 --> 00:01:38,020
♪Our paths now part, and I cannot make you stay♪

7
00:01:38,380 --> 00:01:45,140
♪If love is deadly poison, hate is a furnace that sears the heart♪

8
00:01:46,380 --> 00:01:53,020
♪What is devotion? I fool my heart and spin my own cocoon♪

9
00:01:54,220 --> 00:02:01,060
♪Anger, obsession, greed, resentment, and envy bring trials across lifetimes♪

10
00:02:02,660 --> 00:02:09,180
♪The past turns to dust. I regret nothing, though my love was misplaced♪

11
00:02:13,940 --> 00:02:15,740
[Blossom in Darkness]

12
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:17,740
[Based on the novel "Blossom in Darkness" by Guo Guo]

13
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:20,740
[Episode 16]

14
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:25,620
Youyou?

15
00:02:28,520 --> 00:02:29,970
You came back from 900 years ago, too?

16
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:30,970
How dare you!

17
00:02:31,870 --> 00:02:33,370
How do you know my childhood nickname?

18
00:02:33,870 --> 00:02:35,530
You will address me as

19
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:36,650
the Demon Queen.

20
00:02:42,290 --> 00:02:43,620
This portal leads to the past.

21
00:02:43,800 --> 00:02:45,180
Find the mighty ancient demon I used to be.

22
00:02:45,480 --> 00:02:46,930
This is our only chance to survive.

23
00:02:47,280 --> 00:02:48,920
She'll use her talisman to save you.

24
00:02:50,150 --> 00:02:52,970
Has the Saintess of the Tides been born yet?

25
00:02:54,200 --> 00:02:56,090
That was ages ago.

26
00:02:57,150 --> 00:02:58,610
The Saintess of the Tides

27
00:02:58,610 --> 00:03:00,510
was killed a century ago

28
00:03:00,510 --> 00:03:01,510
by that devil, Qi Fengyin.

29
00:03:01,550 --> 00:03:02,370
What about Qi Fengyin?

30
00:03:02,990 --> 00:03:04,530
Sealed away on Mount Qihuang, of course.

31
00:03:04,870 --> 00:03:06,690
The Saintess died a century ago.

32
00:03:07,110 --> 00:03:07,690
Then that means

33
00:03:08,140 --> 00:03:08,860
Youyou sent me

34
00:03:08,860 --> 00:03:09,940
900 years into the past.

35
00:03:16,960 --> 00:03:18,780
I could smell this rare medicinal fragrance

36
00:03:18,800 --> 00:03:20,370
from miles away.

37
00:03:20,670 --> 00:03:22,060
Legend speaks of a mystical herb,

38
00:03:22,110 --> 00:03:23,340
the Moonlit Revival Herb.

39
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:25,020
It can cure any illness

40
00:03:25,110 --> 00:03:26,250
and greatly boost one's cultivation.

41
00:03:26,590 --> 00:03:27,530
Good thing I'm not too late.

42
00:03:27,670 --> 00:03:28,500
You're not quite dead yet.

43
00:03:31,420 --> 00:03:32,770
Your future self, 900 years from now,

44
00:03:32,800 --> 00:03:33,870
sent me here

45
00:03:33,870 --> 00:03:34,740
to borrow your Demon Soul Talisman.

46
00:03:34,760 --> 00:03:35,690
Who are you to even mention

47
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:37,410
the Demon Soul Talisman?

48
00:03:38,080 --> 00:03:38,500
I...

49
00:03:41,060 --> 00:03:50,340
[Luoliang Demon Capital]

50
00:03:57,320 --> 00:03:57,940
Come on!

51
00:03:58,320 --> 00:03:59,460
- Wait for me! - Hurry up!

52
00:04:01,550 --> 00:04:02,530
I want one, too.

53
00:04:02,690 --> 00:04:03,370
I'll take this one.

54
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,370
I'm back!

55
00:04:22,710 --> 00:04:23,810
Hurry! Let's get out of here!

56
00:04:33,080 --> 00:04:33,420
You...

57
00:04:33,440 --> 00:04:34,980
Looks like nobody wants you around.

58
00:04:35,390 --> 00:04:35,740
Get back!

59
00:04:36,390 --> 00:04:37,300
You're about to die,

60
00:04:37,300 --> 00:04:38,020
and you still won't stop talking.

61
00:04:38,320 --> 00:04:39,810
Believe me, I could eat you right now!

62
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:44,330
Your blood must smell too strong.

63
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,370
That's why my demons are in an uproar.

64
00:04:47,080 --> 00:04:48,500
I'll have to put another seal on you.

65
00:05:00,780 --> 00:05:02,660
[Spring Breeze Pavilion]

66
00:05:06,100 --> 00:05:07,900
[Demon Capital Inn]

67
00:05:16,030 --> 00:05:16,980
Luoliang Immortal City?

68
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:18,570
What are you talking about?

69
00:05:21,340 --> 00:05:24,220
[Luoliang Demon Capital]

70
00:05:24,910 --> 00:05:26,450
This is my Luoliang Demon Capital.

71
00:05:26,830 --> 00:05:28,370
I built this entire city myself.

72
00:05:28,830 --> 00:05:29,740
This is my territory.

73
00:05:39,080 --> 00:05:40,130
Nothing pleases me more

74
00:05:40,150 --> 00:05:41,860
than collecting gold and treasure.

75
00:05:42,230 --> 00:05:43,770
These are my prized possessions.

76
00:05:43,910 --> 00:05:45,130
The more I hoard, the safer I feel.

77
00:05:45,610 --> 00:05:47,630
And now you're part of my collection.

78
00:05:48,230 --> 00:05:49,210
The Moonlit Revival Herb

79
00:05:49,660 --> 00:05:50,800
is a rare treasure.

80
00:05:51,150 --> 00:05:52,880
New Year's Eve is almost here.

81
00:05:53,200 --> 00:05:54,720
I'll chop you to pieces

82
00:05:54,720 --> 00:05:55,790
and make a lavish feast of you.

83
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:56,900
Every demon in the capital

84
00:05:56,900 --> 00:05:58,100
will get a share.

85
00:05:58,440 --> 00:05:59,860
You'll only bring trouble on yourself.

86
00:06:01,120 --> 00:06:01,820
900 years from now,

87
00:06:01,820 --> 00:06:02,940
you'll face a terrible calamity.

88
00:06:03,320 --> 00:06:04,420
Your only hope is to use the Demon Soul Talisman

89
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,470
to open a portal through time

90
00:06:05,470 --> 00:06:06,420
and escape.

91
00:06:06,710 --> 00:06:07,600
You sent me back here,

92
00:06:07,640 --> 00:06:09,060
but you're still in danger.

93
00:06:09,200 --> 00:06:09,790
Youyou.

94
00:06:09,880 --> 00:06:11,690
Helping me now means saving yourself.

95
00:06:12,960 --> 00:06:13,810
Let me get this straight.

96
00:06:14,150 --> 00:06:15,250
You're saying

97
00:06:15,590 --> 00:06:16,940
that 900 years from now,

98
00:06:17,200 --> 00:06:18,100
to protect you,

99
00:06:18,270 --> 00:06:19,690
I opened a portal through time.

100
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:21,060
And after sending you here,

101
00:06:21,200 --> 00:06:22,210
my future self

102
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:23,860
is waiting for you to come save me?

103
00:06:27,320 --> 00:06:28,880
Nobody knows me better than I do.

104
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:29,660
Why would I ever

105
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:30,820
use the talisman's power

106
00:06:30,880 --> 00:06:31,950
for something like that?

107
00:06:32,350 --> 00:06:32,620
You...

108
00:06:32,680 --> 00:06:34,010
- I... - Even if that's true,

109
00:06:34,110 --> 00:06:35,290
my future self

110
00:06:35,290 --> 00:06:36,080
must have tricked you

111
00:06:36,080 --> 00:06:36,900
into coming here

112
00:06:36,900 --> 00:06:37,930
just to have you for dinner.

113
00:06:38,190 --> 00:06:38,780
Don't worry.

114
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:39,680
I know a delicacy when I see one.

115
00:06:39,830 --> 00:06:41,100
When the time comes, I won't waste

116
00:06:41,120 --> 00:06:41,980
even a single strand of your hair.

117
00:06:42,630 --> 00:06:43,100
No, listen!

118
00:06:43,190 --> 00:06:43,700
If either one of us

119
00:06:43,720 --> 00:06:44,840
were lying,

120
00:06:44,840 --> 00:06:46,250
there's no way I could be here!

121
00:06:48,160 --> 00:06:49,050
If your future self

122
00:06:49,070 --> 00:06:50,140
could just eat me,

123
00:06:50,430 --> 00:06:51,290
why go through all that trouble

124
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,100
to send me back here?

125
00:06:52,360 --> 00:06:52,980
Good point.

126
00:06:53,390 --> 00:06:54,100
Why bother?

127
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:56,610
That's exactly why I don't believe

128
00:06:56,720 --> 00:06:58,290
a word of your story about 900 years

129
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,610
or even 9,000 years from now.

130
00:07:02,680 --> 00:07:03,410
And another thing.

131
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:06,640
If you dare mention

132
00:07:06,640 --> 00:07:08,180
the Demon Soul Talisman again,

133
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,220
I'll cut out your tongue and eat it.

134
00:07:19,230 --> 00:07:20,060
The Demon Soul Talisman clearly

135
00:07:20,060 --> 00:07:21,430
has the power to open portals through time.

136
00:07:21,870 --> 00:07:23,660
Why won't Youyou believe me?

137
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:27,170
And now I've lost track of Qi Fengyin.

138
00:07:27,870 --> 00:07:29,370
Youyou is in the Saintess's hands.

139
00:07:29,480 --> 00:07:30,800
Not sure how things are going.

140
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:35,880
I have to find a way

141
00:07:35,880 --> 00:07:37,020
to escape from here.

142
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:04,930
This magical artifact is completely

143
00:08:04,950 --> 00:08:05,970
unaffected by spiritual power.

144
00:08:12,480 --> 00:08:13,250
Master...

145
00:08:34,870 --> 00:08:35,940
This is all my fault.

146
00:08:37,360 --> 00:08:39,100
I wasted too much time.

147
00:08:40,080 --> 00:08:41,820
I was so close.

148
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:56,180
If you're going to eat me, just do it!

149
00:08:56,440 --> 00:08:57,460
Stop wasting time.

150
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:00,700
It's me.

151
00:09:13,870 --> 00:09:15,940
A demon spell was masking the scent of your blood.

152
00:09:17,150 --> 00:09:18,220
It took quite a bit of effort

153
00:09:18,270 --> 00:09:19,060
to track you down.

154
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:20,490
And while I was at it,

155
00:09:20,790 --> 00:09:22,340
I found some ointment for your wounds.

156
00:09:55,360 --> 00:09:56,730
You've already done more than enough.

157
00:09:59,080 --> 00:10:01,530
But I've tried so hard.

158
00:10:03,320 --> 00:10:04,640
I've done everything

159
00:10:04,640 --> 00:10:06,120
I could possibly think of.

160
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,820
But no matter what I try,

161
00:10:09,840 --> 00:10:12,010
it all ends up being for nothing.

162
00:10:12,630 --> 00:10:14,340
When I left Luoshen Valley,

163
00:10:14,910 --> 00:10:15,700
I never imagined

164
00:10:15,750 --> 00:10:16,690
the journey to Mount Zhaowu

165
00:10:16,690 --> 00:10:17,700
would be this long.

166
00:10:19,670 --> 00:10:21,610
It feels like there's no end in sight.

167
00:10:25,200 --> 00:10:26,340
And now Master is...

168
00:10:38,440 --> 00:10:40,060
Destroy my spirit.

169
00:10:40,840 --> 00:10:41,770
Take this body

170
00:10:41,790 --> 00:10:42,730
and go find the malice you need.

171
00:10:43,390 --> 00:10:44,220
Qi Fengyin.

172
00:10:46,960 --> 00:10:47,580
I'm tired.

173
00:10:52,200 --> 00:10:53,300
Did you really come all this way

174
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,850
just to save your master?

175
00:11:10,790 --> 00:11:11,580
My ring...

176
00:11:13,360 --> 00:11:14,940
When Master's soul crystal

177
00:11:15,000 --> 00:11:15,700
stopped responding,

178
00:11:16,270 --> 00:11:17,770
I thought the ring had vanished with it.

179
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:19,250
There should still be someone

180
00:11:19,910 --> 00:11:20,940
who can save Danshen.

181
00:11:23,790 --> 00:11:24,980
We're 900 years in the past.

182
00:11:25,030 --> 00:11:26,070
Master is still alive!

183
00:11:26,150 --> 00:11:27,600
Find him in Luoshen Valley.

184
00:11:28,200 --> 00:11:29,250
Maybe he can be awakened.

185
00:11:32,270 --> 00:11:32,700
I...

186
00:11:42,600 --> 00:11:44,180
These shackles can only hold one person.

187
00:11:49,870 --> 00:11:50,650
It's all right.

188
00:11:51,270 --> 00:11:52,300
I still have some power left.

189
00:11:52,790 --> 00:11:53,730
But you're no match

190
00:11:53,750 --> 00:11:54,710
for Youyou as she is now.

191
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:56,100
What if she finds out

192
00:11:56,320 --> 00:11:58,100
you're staying here in my place?

193
00:12:06,870 --> 00:12:08,220
This way, she won't be able to tell.

194
00:12:19,790 --> 00:12:20,730
You must be careful.

195
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:22,890
Don't let Youyou eat you.

196
00:12:25,360 --> 00:12:26,770
I just need a little more time

197
00:12:27,080 --> 00:12:28,370
to bring the Wanjun Lock under control.

198
00:12:28,870 --> 00:12:30,130
Don't worry about me once you leave.

199
00:12:30,510 --> 00:12:31,420
And don't come back.

200
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:16,820
What happened

201
00:13:17,080 --> 00:13:18,250
between you two 1,000 years ago

202
00:13:18,510 --> 00:13:19,940
that makes you so determined to kill him?

203
00:13:20,270 --> 00:13:21,180
This has nothing to do with a grudge.

204
00:13:21,720 --> 00:13:23,130
It's our destiny.

205
00:13:23,750 --> 00:13:24,420
Destiny?

206
00:13:25,960 --> 00:13:27,730
Before I was sealed on Mount Qihuang,

207
00:13:29,390 --> 00:13:30,820
what exactly happened?

208
00:13:42,390 --> 00:13:43,220
Luoshen Valley.

209
00:13:44,600 --> 00:13:45,460
I'm finally back.

210
00:13:59,320 --> 00:14:00,330
Why does this place look

211
00:14:00,330 --> 00:14:01,600
like no one's ever been here?

212
00:14:03,320 --> 00:14:04,890
Master guarded this mountain for a thousand years.

213
00:14:05,550 --> 00:14:06,750
By now, he should

214
00:14:06,750 --> 00:14:07,980
already be here in Luoshen Valley.

215
00:14:08,270 --> 00:14:09,650
Master's residence is gone.

216
00:14:11,030 --> 00:14:11,770
The library is gone.

217
00:14:12,390 --> 00:14:13,420
Even the garden pavilion is gone.

218
00:14:16,840 --> 00:14:17,370
How is this possible?

219
00:14:21,240 --> 00:14:22,580
The Saintess's Shrine.

220
00:14:23,630 --> 00:14:24,340
As long as the shrine is here,

221
00:14:24,870 --> 00:14:25,700
he must be here too.

222
00:14:47,510 --> 00:14:48,530
Where's the shrine?

223
00:14:51,120 --> 00:14:52,490
Even the shrine is gone.

224
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:06,980
Miss.

225
00:16:13,510 --> 00:16:14,250
Master?

226
00:16:20,790 --> 00:16:21,420
Miss.

227
00:16:21,840 --> 00:16:23,850
What brings you to this deserted place?

228
00:16:28,220 --> 00:16:33,460
♪The past has left its scars upon my eyes♪

229
00:16:33,940 --> 00:16:39,940
♪The wind brings yet more sorrow...♪

230
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:45,460
Master.

231
00:16:46,840 --> 00:16:47,460
It seems

232
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:48,890
you and I

233
00:16:49,440 --> 00:16:50,730
already know each other.

234
00:16:55,300 --> 00:17:00,860
♪How can I forget the love we shared?♪

235
00:17:01,340 --> 00:17:06,460
♪Our story is suddenly shrouded in sorrow♪

236
00:17:07,140 --> 00:17:12,780
♪The dream drags on. Looking back breaks my heart♪

237
00:17:13,220 --> 00:17:18,420
♪In the end, all we had fades into nothing♪

238
00:17:30,920 --> 00:17:32,010
This place is protected by a seal.

239
00:17:32,510 --> 00:17:34,330
Even if an outsider wanders in by accident,

240
00:17:34,550 --> 00:17:35,570
they won't see its true appearance.

241
00:17:36,400 --> 00:17:37,180
They'll simply think it's

242
00:17:37,590 --> 00:17:39,330
a remote, deserted valley.

243
00:17:56,070 --> 00:17:56,980
Feeling better?

244
00:18:03,070 --> 00:18:05,290
I never imagined there was an artifact

245
00:18:05,640 --> 00:18:06,900
that could reach into the past

246
00:18:07,310 --> 00:18:08,420
and travel through time.

247
00:18:09,110 --> 00:18:09,460
Mas...

248
00:18:11,830 --> 00:18:13,180
You believe what I've told you?

249
00:18:13,590 --> 00:18:14,180
Of course.

250
00:18:14,790 --> 00:18:16,600
Near the Saintess's Shrine,

251
00:18:16,660 --> 00:18:17,750
there is indeed a mystical herb.

252
00:18:17,960 --> 00:18:18,980
It hasn't taken human form yet,

253
00:18:19,750 --> 00:18:21,380
but it has the same aura as you.

254
00:18:25,880 --> 00:18:27,050
You came all this way to find me.

255
00:18:27,880 --> 00:18:28,570
You must've

256
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:30,490
had a rough time, too.

257
00:18:38,270 --> 00:18:39,090
900 years from now,

258
00:18:39,720 --> 00:18:41,010
you'll face a terrible calamity.

259
00:18:41,200 --> 00:18:42,770
Your energy will be drained, and your body will wither.

260
00:18:43,240 --> 00:18:44,330
You'll turn into this soul crystal.

261
00:18:44,590 --> 00:18:45,900
I've tried so many ways to save you,

262
00:18:46,160 --> 00:18:47,530
but I still can't awaken it.

263
00:18:49,680 --> 00:18:51,050
The crystal hasn't been damaged at all.

264
00:18:51,310 --> 00:18:52,220
But half a month ago,

265
00:18:52,270 --> 00:18:53,050
my connection to it

266
00:18:53,050 --> 00:18:54,380
started growing weaker and weaker.

267
00:18:54,880 --> 00:18:55,570
And now,

268
00:18:55,960 --> 00:18:56,660
I can't even sense

269
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:57,900
the slightest response from it.

270
00:18:58,790 --> 00:18:59,420
Master,

271
00:18:59,920 --> 00:19:01,090
can this soul crystal still be restored?

272
00:19:03,200 --> 00:19:04,330
Sealed inside it

273
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:05,570
is my own soul.

274
00:19:06,160 --> 00:19:07,380
Even I'm not worried.

275
00:19:07,680 --> 00:19:08,810
Why are you so frightened?

276
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:16,730
Right now,

277
00:19:17,310 --> 00:19:19,050
I'm still just a wild herb without human form.

278
00:19:20,310 --> 00:19:21,330
You haven't met me yet,

279
00:19:22,000 --> 00:19:22,860
so you couldn't possibly know

280
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,900
what we'll go through together.

281
00:19:27,480 --> 00:19:28,900
I care more about your safety

282
00:19:29,680 --> 00:19:31,180
than anyone else in this world.

283
00:19:35,830 --> 00:19:36,940
What a strange twist of fate.

284
00:19:37,720 --> 00:19:38,770
Now I have to

285
00:19:39,400 --> 00:19:41,050
save myself 900 years in the future.

286
00:19:43,400 --> 00:19:44,220
Master, does that mean

287
00:19:44,510 --> 00:19:45,090
you can save it?

288
00:19:45,590 --> 00:19:46,250
No one else could.

289
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:47,220
Fortunately,

290
00:19:47,440 --> 00:19:48,770
it was brought to me.

291
00:19:49,160 --> 00:19:51,180
That gives my future self a chance to survive.

292
00:19:56,110 --> 00:19:57,050
The Moonlit Revival Herb

293
00:19:57,440 --> 00:19:58,250
awakens when the moon rises

294
00:19:58,510 --> 00:19:59,290
and rests when the moon sets.

295
00:19:59,680 --> 00:20:01,700
You must be exhausted by now.

296
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:02,860
Restoring the soul crystal

297
00:20:02,860 --> 00:20:04,180
will take some time.

298
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:05,570
You don't have to stay awake waiting for me.

299
00:20:05,920 --> 00:20:06,420
No!

300
00:20:07,160 --> 00:20:08,380
This is the most critical moment.

301
00:20:08,480 --> 00:20:09,330
I've made it this far.

302
00:20:09,590 --> 00:20:09,980
I'm not sleeping.

303
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,220
I'll wait right here.

304
00:21:16,790 --> 00:21:18,010
So that's how things

305
00:21:19,160 --> 00:21:20,620
turned out 900 years from now.

306
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:22,050
Interesting.

307
00:21:39,350 --> 00:21:40,220
Qi Fengyin.

308
00:22:08,070 --> 00:22:08,860
I thought

309
00:22:08,880 --> 00:22:10,330
you'd raise a huge fuss last night.

310
00:22:11,240 --> 00:22:13,050
But you slept like nothing was wrong.

311
00:22:17,830 --> 00:22:18,980
How dare you glare at me!

312
00:22:21,480 --> 00:22:22,890
I'll make a meal of you today.

313
00:22:23,200 --> 00:22:23,700
Go on.

314
00:22:24,480 --> 00:22:25,460
Any last words?

315
00:22:32,400 --> 00:22:32,980
Master?

316
00:22:34,270 --> 00:22:35,490
Why are you up

317
00:22:35,750 --> 00:22:36,530
after only half a day's rest?

318
00:22:40,160 --> 00:22:41,460
Master, where did you go?

319
00:22:42,640 --> 00:22:43,940
You seem terribly weak.

320
00:22:44,830 --> 00:22:45,860
So I used some spiritual power

321
00:22:45,880 --> 00:22:46,860
to make you something to eat.

322
00:22:47,200 --> 00:22:48,090
This valley is quite remote.

323
00:22:48,270 --> 00:22:50,220
I could only find wild fruit to use.

324
00:22:50,510 --> 00:22:52,460
I'm afraid it may not suit your taste.

325
00:22:55,350 --> 00:22:55,980
Master,

326
00:22:56,720 --> 00:22:57,970
how's the soul crystal coming along?

327
00:22:58,110 --> 00:22:59,010
Is there anything I can do to help?

328
00:23:01,070 --> 00:23:02,730
I've already awakened the soul crystal.

329
00:23:03,030 --> 00:23:04,140
With my powers sustaining it,

330
00:23:04,350 --> 00:23:05,570
it only needs a little more time

331
00:23:05,790 --> 00:23:07,090
to fully recover

332
00:23:07,400 --> 00:23:08,180
and regain human form.

333
00:23:11,480 --> 00:23:13,700
But the spiritual energy

334
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:15,700
of the past and present

335
00:23:15,880 --> 00:23:16,620
isn't quite the same.

336
00:23:17,110 --> 00:23:18,980
I'm afraid he won't fully regain consciousness

337
00:23:19,790 --> 00:23:20,220
until

338
00:23:20,590 --> 00:23:22,220
you return to your own time.

339
00:23:24,160 --> 00:23:25,140
So...

340
00:23:25,880 --> 00:23:26,620
I still need to find a way

341
00:23:26,680 --> 00:23:27,730
back to the present.

342
00:23:31,050 --> 00:23:31,700
Master!

343
00:23:37,070 --> 00:23:37,980
Let me take a look.

344
00:23:50,200 --> 00:23:51,770
Since this calamity was fated,

345
00:23:52,110 --> 00:23:53,050
escaping it

346
00:23:53,350 --> 00:23:54,810
was bound to come at a price.

347
00:23:55,550 --> 00:23:57,700
I've sacrificed half my immortal core

348
00:23:57,880 --> 00:23:58,860
and half a lifetime of cultivation.

349
00:23:59,790 --> 00:24:00,700
But at least I've ensured

350
00:24:01,310 --> 00:24:03,140
that I'll still be alive 900 years from now.

351
00:24:03,590 --> 00:24:04,570
You have nothing to blame yourself for.

352
00:24:05,160 --> 00:24:07,140
And there's no need to be sad.

353
00:24:10,070 --> 00:24:11,250
So Master's deep-seated weakness

354
00:24:11,510 --> 00:24:12,460
started

355
00:24:13,310 --> 00:24:14,770
right here, in this moment.

356
00:24:16,920 --> 00:24:18,180
Just knowing that one day

357
00:24:18,440 --> 00:24:19,770
I'll have such a wonderful disciple,

358
00:24:20,240 --> 00:24:22,050
willing to brave anything to save me,

359
00:24:22,200 --> 00:24:23,220
makes 900 years of illness

360
00:24:23,350 --> 00:24:24,250
seem like nothing at all.

361
00:24:24,750 --> 00:24:25,330
At least

362
00:24:25,510 --> 00:24:26,530
it all ends well,

363
00:24:26,960 --> 00:24:27,530
doesn't it?

364
00:24:31,880 --> 00:24:32,380
All right.

365
00:24:32,440 --> 00:24:33,290
You're still injured.

366
00:24:33,510 --> 00:24:35,010
Stay in Luoshen Valley and rest.

367
00:24:35,400 --> 00:24:36,770
I'll clear some space

368
00:24:36,960 --> 00:24:38,010
and build you a place to stay.

369
00:24:38,310 --> 00:24:38,940
Master.

370
00:24:43,590 --> 00:24:44,250
What is it?

371
00:24:44,830 --> 00:24:45,980
Don't you want to stay with me?

372
00:24:47,200 --> 00:24:47,730
I do.

373
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:50,940
But there's someone

374
00:24:51,830 --> 00:24:52,770
I'm worried about.

375
00:24:53,640 --> 00:24:54,530
I have to find him.

376
00:24:57,200 --> 00:24:59,250
It seems this person

377
00:24:59,680 --> 00:25:00,420
means a great deal to you.

378
00:25:04,900 --> 00:25:05,730
In that case,

379
00:25:06,070 --> 00:25:07,380
I won't make you stay.

380
00:25:08,200 --> 00:25:08,770
Go on, then.

381
00:25:13,030 --> 00:25:13,660
Master.

382
00:25:14,110 --> 00:25:14,860
Once I leave,

383
00:25:15,070 --> 00:25:15,860
we won't meet again

384
00:25:16,270 --> 00:25:17,420
for hundreds of years.

385
00:25:17,680 --> 00:25:18,460
When you see me again,

386
00:25:19,070 --> 00:25:20,570
promise you won't send me to Mount Zhaowu.

387
00:25:35,920 --> 00:25:36,900
I gave you

388
00:25:36,920 --> 00:25:38,420
all night to think.

389
00:25:40,030 --> 00:25:40,980
Still no last words?

390
00:25:41,310 --> 00:25:42,490
Then have you decided whether you want to be

391
00:25:42,510 --> 00:25:43,420
sweet and sour or braised?

392
00:25:50,480 --> 00:25:51,900
If you can't decide,

393
00:25:52,160 --> 00:25:52,860
I'll just make you

394
00:25:52,960 --> 00:25:54,220
the way I like it.

395
00:26:07,750 --> 00:26:09,860
I was only trying to scare you yesterday.

396
00:26:10,160 --> 00:26:11,490
I didn't actually cut out your tongue.

397
00:26:11,750 --> 00:26:13,090
So why can't you say a word?

398
00:26:17,750 --> 00:26:19,290
Did I scare you senseless?

399
00:26:21,830 --> 00:26:22,860
If I eat a fool,

400
00:26:23,110 --> 00:26:24,140
will I turn into one too?

401
00:26:47,680 --> 00:26:48,980
I was waiting for my powers to recover.

402
00:26:49,640 --> 00:26:50,530
What were you waiting for?

403
00:27:03,400 --> 00:27:04,530
It's been a full day and night.

404
00:27:05,310 --> 00:27:06,730
I hope Qi Fengyin is all right.

405
00:27:18,070 --> 00:27:20,290
I can't believe you dared to come back.

406
00:27:39,160 --> 00:27:40,180
Now that's the right aura.

407
00:27:40,830 --> 00:27:42,010
Finally, the real one.

408
00:27:42,350 --> 00:27:43,050
Did she figure out

409
00:27:43,070 --> 00:27:43,980
that Qi Fengyin

410
00:27:44,000 --> 00:27:44,660
was impersonating me?

411
00:27:44,790 --> 00:27:45,220
Talk.

412
00:27:45,550 --> 00:27:47,400
What's your connection to Qi Fengyin?

413
00:27:47,450 --> 00:27:47,850
You...

414
00:27:48,030 --> 00:27:49,420
How do you know he was Qi Fengyin?

415
00:27:51,310 --> 00:27:52,530
That was Qi Fengyin!

416
00:27:52,790 --> 00:27:53,440
The most vicious devil

417
00:27:53,440 --> 00:27:55,010
in the entire world.

418
00:27:55,240 --> 00:27:56,420
He can do just about anything,

419
00:27:56,440 --> 00:27:56,810
all right?

420
00:27:56,950 --> 00:27:58,290
The leaders of the Five Great Sects...

421
00:27:58,310 --> 00:27:59,530
Even together, they couldn't beat him.

422
00:28:00,350 --> 00:28:01,380
Remember the Saintess of the Tides?

423
00:28:01,440 --> 00:28:02,380
The one you asked me about the other day?

424
00:28:03,070 --> 00:28:04,490
Even she couldn't defeat Qi Fengyin.

425
00:28:04,640 --> 00:28:06,420
She could only seal him on Mount Qihuang.

426
00:28:06,750 --> 00:28:07,620
But who would've thought

427
00:28:07,620 --> 00:28:09,290
he'd break the divine seal

428
00:28:09,350 --> 00:28:10,310
and come all the way here

429
00:28:10,920 --> 00:28:12,050
to take your place in confinement?

430
00:28:12,830 --> 00:28:14,180
What's your relationship with him?

431
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,380
Why do you sound like

432
00:28:16,680 --> 00:28:17,900
you admire him so much?

433
00:28:20,070 --> 00:28:22,090
So he's gone now?

434
00:28:22,350 --> 00:28:22,980
Of course.

435
00:28:23,070 --> 00:28:23,810
I couldn't beat him.

436
00:28:24,070 --> 00:28:25,220
I personally escorted him out.

437
00:28:26,070 --> 00:28:27,900
He's brought the Wanjun Lock under control?

438
00:28:28,830 --> 00:28:30,220
Now that he's free,

439
00:28:31,110 --> 00:28:32,490
I can use his reputation

440
00:28:32,510 --> 00:28:33,380
to keep Youyou in check.

441
00:28:43,720 --> 00:28:45,490
You know he's the most powerful

442
00:28:45,510 --> 00:28:47,140
devil in the world.

443
00:28:47,440 --> 00:28:49,010
No one's ever been able to defeat him.

444
00:28:49,310 --> 00:28:50,730
Yet he willingly let himself be locked

445
00:28:51,070 --> 00:28:52,420
in that stone chamber for me.

446
00:28:53,920 --> 00:28:55,490
What do you think that makes us?

447
00:28:56,000 --> 00:28:56,810
What does it make you?

448
00:29:02,400 --> 00:29:03,290
He's in love with me.

449
00:29:06,510 --> 00:29:07,860
Qi Fengyin

450
00:29:08,960 --> 00:29:10,210
is wrapped around

451
00:29:10,920 --> 00:29:12,140
my little finger.

452
00:29:12,640 --> 00:29:14,040
He can't resist my charms.

453
00:29:14,040 --> 00:29:14,940
He's completely obsessed with me.

454
00:29:15,550 --> 00:29:17,250
That's why wherever I go,

455
00:29:17,310 --> 00:29:18,180
he follows.

456
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:21,590
So when you said yesterday

457
00:29:21,640 --> 00:29:23,490
you came back from 900 years in the future,

458
00:29:23,640 --> 00:29:24,420
you really were lying to me.

459
00:29:24,790 --> 00:29:25,490
Of course not!

460
00:29:25,830 --> 00:29:26,180
I...

461
00:29:27,350 --> 00:29:29,010
I've just been back for a while.

462
00:29:29,400 --> 00:29:30,900
I wandered onto Mount Qihuang

463
00:29:31,350 --> 00:29:32,330
and happened to meet Qi Fengyin.

464
00:29:32,510 --> 00:29:34,900
It was love at first sight for him!

465
00:29:35,070 --> 00:29:36,330
He's utterly devoted to me.

466
00:29:36,720 --> 00:29:38,090
He treats me like his greatest treasure.

467
00:29:38,640 --> 00:29:39,380
So,

468
00:29:40,110 --> 00:29:41,570
if you dare eat me,

469
00:29:41,880 --> 00:29:43,940
Qi Fengyin will never let you get away with it.

470
00:29:46,720 --> 00:29:47,770
She's letting me go just like that?

471
00:29:48,560 --> 00:29:50,760
Is Qi Fengyin's name really that powerful,

472
00:29:51,000 --> 00:29:52,570
or is this Youyou just...

473
00:29:53,070 --> 00:29:54,530
I've decided not to eat you.

474
00:29:55,570 --> 00:29:56,830
With Qi Fengyin around,

475
00:29:56,830 --> 00:29:57,890
you couldn't eat me anyway.

476
00:29:57,920 --> 00:29:59,470
Didn't you say

477
00:29:59,480 --> 00:30:00,620
you wanted to use the talisman's power

478
00:30:00,640 --> 00:30:01,760
to return 900 years into the future?

479
00:30:02,240 --> 00:30:02,980
I'll help you.

480
00:30:03,830 --> 00:30:05,420
But I have one condition.

481
00:30:07,160 --> 00:30:07,860
What condition?

482
00:30:08,070 --> 00:30:10,330
I'm appointing you as my advisor.

483
00:30:22,000 --> 00:30:23,250
There's plenty of spiritual energy here.

484
00:30:23,680 --> 00:30:24,150
This must be

485
00:30:24,150 --> 00:30:25,620
a minor sect under the Five Great Sects.

486
00:30:26,200 --> 00:30:27,180
Why did you bring me here?

487
00:30:53,420 --> 00:30:57,500
[Shen Wangyan, Leader of Yunyi Sect]

488
00:31:03,070 --> 00:31:03,660
You came all this way

489
00:31:03,680 --> 00:31:04,770
just to see that man?

490
00:31:08,240 --> 00:31:08,940
Who is he?

491
00:31:10,160 --> 00:31:11,380
The leader of Yunyi Sect,

492
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:12,290
Shen Wangyan.

493
00:31:13,110 --> 00:31:13,900
His zither playing

494
00:31:14,070 --> 00:31:15,420
is so beautiful.

495
00:31:16,350 --> 00:31:17,050
And he's

496
00:31:17,160 --> 00:31:18,460
quite handsome, too.

497
00:31:22,750 --> 00:31:24,030
You actually have a thing for

498
00:31:24,030 --> 00:31:25,030
a cultivator?

499
00:31:25,640 --> 00:31:26,140
Didn't you used to

500
00:31:26,480 --> 00:31:27,980
hate the way those immortals smelled?

501
00:31:28,310 --> 00:31:29,180
You even called it

502
00:31:29,510 --> 00:31:30,530
their immortal stink.

503
00:31:32,270 --> 00:31:32,940
What are you talking about?

504
00:31:33,350 --> 00:31:34,570
Don't you dare talk about Shen Wangyan like that.

505
00:31:35,240 --> 00:31:36,090
You have no taste.

506
00:31:51,920 --> 00:31:52,460
Come on, let's go.

507
00:32:03,880 --> 00:32:05,090
What

508
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:07,140
do you think

509
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:08,530
of Shen Wangyan?

510
00:32:09,480 --> 00:32:10,490
You like him?

511
00:32:14,070 --> 00:32:15,940
I made you my advisor

512
00:32:16,160 --> 00:32:17,660
because you managed to win over

513
00:32:17,680 --> 00:32:18,690
the most ruthless man alive,

514
00:32:18,690 --> 00:32:19,860
Qi Fengyin.

515
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:21,530
You can surely help me marry Shen Wangyan.

516
00:32:22,960 --> 00:32:23,330
You...

517
00:32:23,920 --> 00:32:24,180
I...

518
00:32:26,240 --> 00:32:27,530
You want to marry him?

519
00:32:28,550 --> 00:32:30,220
But he's the leader of an immortal sect!

520
00:32:30,790 --> 00:32:31,570
It's a tiny sect.

521
00:32:31,590 --> 00:32:32,620
There aren't many disciples anyway.

522
00:32:34,720 --> 00:32:35,620
But immortals and demons

523
00:32:35,680 --> 00:32:36,620
have been enemies for ages.

524
00:32:36,880 --> 00:32:38,290
How can you fall for an immortal?

525
00:32:38,310 --> 00:32:40,010
You're so old-fashioned!

526
00:32:42,440 --> 00:32:43,480
He's good to me,

527
00:32:43,480 --> 00:32:44,700
so of course I like him.

528
00:32:45,030 --> 00:32:46,980
That's why I'm going to marry him

529
00:32:47,030 --> 00:32:48,180
and make him my Demon King Consort.

530
00:32:51,070 --> 00:32:52,090
How has he been good to you?

531
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:55,620
You know how much I love

532
00:32:55,640 --> 00:32:56,620
collecting things like

533
00:32:56,720 --> 00:32:57,730
gold and jewels,

534
00:32:57,750 --> 00:32:59,090
and legendary magical artifacts,

535
00:32:59,110 --> 00:32:59,860
right?

536
00:32:59,920 --> 00:33:01,900
Well, I heard Yunyi Sect had

537
00:33:01,900 --> 00:33:03,220
a legendary Floating Shadow Zither.

538
00:33:03,550 --> 00:33:05,460
And it's close to Luoliang Demon Capital.

539
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:08,570
So one day, I snuck over to steal it.

540
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:57,140
This place is guarded by powerful arrays.

541
00:33:57,880 --> 00:33:58,870
If this spiritual power strikes

542
00:33:58,870 --> 00:33:59,660
an ordinary person,

543
00:33:59,920 --> 00:34:00,770
it'll feel like a normal blow.

544
00:34:01,030 --> 00:34:01,730
But for demons,

545
00:34:01,750 --> 00:34:02,810
the pain cuts right to the bone.

546
00:34:03,000 --> 00:34:04,220
You shouldn't have barged in here.

547
00:34:05,750 --> 00:34:07,090
I've got my eye on this zither.

548
00:34:07,350 --> 00:34:08,130
And I'm taking it!

549
00:34:13,510 --> 00:34:13,900
Don't move.

550
00:34:53,840 --> 00:34:54,820
How are you feeling, miss?

551
00:35:02,360 --> 00:35:02,980
All better.

552
00:35:05,710 --> 00:35:06,570
This Floating Shadow Zither

553
00:35:06,710 --> 00:35:08,130
is our sect's sacred heirloom.

554
00:35:08,670 --> 00:35:09,860
Only the sect leaders

555
00:35:10,110 --> 00:35:11,610
and their wives may play it.

556
00:35:12,150 --> 00:35:13,340
Then I'll marry you!

557
00:35:16,550 --> 00:35:17,530
You're certainly

558
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,260
very straightforward.

559
00:35:31,990 --> 00:35:34,100
So you two got engaged?

560
00:35:36,960 --> 00:35:38,100
If it were that easy

561
00:35:38,100 --> 00:35:38,930
to get engaged,

562
00:35:38,930 --> 00:35:40,010
why would I need you?

563
00:35:40,670 --> 00:35:42,420
Then he said I couldn't take a hint

564
00:35:42,710 --> 00:35:44,260
and threw me out of Yunyi Sect.

565
00:35:45,480 --> 00:35:47,050
It's just a zither.

566
00:35:47,360 --> 00:35:48,660
You'd actually marry Shen Wangyan

567
00:35:48,710 --> 00:35:49,800
just for a zither?

568
00:35:49,840 --> 00:35:50,420
Is it really worth it?

569
00:35:50,590 --> 00:35:52,090
Isn't that a little foolish?

570
00:35:52,480 --> 00:35:53,810
It's not about the zither!

571
00:35:53,810 --> 00:35:54,980
It's about the man!

572
00:35:55,230 --> 00:35:56,050
Shen Wangyan!

573
00:35:59,280 --> 00:36:00,010
Anyway, that day,

574
00:36:00,280 --> 00:36:01,610
I was fully prepared

575
00:36:01,630 --> 00:36:03,060
to put up a fight

576
00:36:03,060 --> 00:36:03,890
if I had to.

577
00:36:04,110 --> 00:36:05,090
But to my surprise,

578
00:36:06,080 --> 00:36:07,850
he didn't even hold it against me

579
00:36:07,850 --> 00:36:09,690
that I'd tried to steal his sect's sacred treasure.

580
00:36:10,030 --> 00:36:11,050
He even treated my wounds.

581
00:36:12,550 --> 00:36:14,030
He's honestly the only person

582
00:36:14,130 --> 00:36:15,530
I've ever met who was kind to me.

583
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:17,700
What's wrong with me liking someone

584
00:36:17,700 --> 00:36:18,530
who treats me well?

585
00:36:18,880 --> 00:36:19,650
Nothing at all.

586
00:36:21,030 --> 00:36:22,570
You're the Demon Queen.

587
00:36:23,000 --> 00:36:24,940
The entire Luoliang Demon Capital is yours.

588
00:36:25,110 --> 00:36:27,690
Your people adore and support you.

589
00:36:28,150 --> 00:36:29,530
How could no one treat you well?

590
00:36:32,510 --> 00:36:34,490
Those demons...

591
00:36:35,320 --> 00:36:35,940
I captured them

592
00:36:35,960 --> 00:36:36,650
and locked them inside the city.

593
00:36:37,510 --> 00:36:38,410
You captured them

594
00:36:38,410 --> 00:36:39,210
and locked them all up?

595
00:36:41,590 --> 00:36:43,650
I was just so lonely

596
00:36:43,670 --> 00:36:45,090
that I built Luoliang Demon Capital.

597
00:36:45,630 --> 00:36:46,010
Yes,

598
00:36:46,230 --> 00:36:49,010
I did capture some demons

599
00:36:49,030 --> 00:36:49,650
and lock them up here.

600
00:36:50,190 --> 00:36:52,010
But I wanted to be the kind of...

601
00:36:52,190 --> 00:36:53,380
loved and admired

602
00:36:53,400 --> 00:36:54,820
by every demon in my kingdom.

603
00:36:55,070 --> 00:36:56,090
But no matter how much

604
00:36:56,110 --> 00:36:57,050
gold and treasure I give them,

605
00:36:57,070 --> 00:36:58,090
they're still terrified of me.

606
00:36:58,150 --> 00:36:58,940
I can't do anything about it.

607
00:36:59,480 --> 00:37:00,570
So I think

608
00:37:00,840 --> 00:37:01,860
I need someone

609
00:37:02,030 --> 00:37:03,210
like Shen Wangyan,

610
00:37:03,440 --> 00:37:04,610
a kind and virtuous Demon King Consort,

611
00:37:04,760 --> 00:37:06,300
to help me run Luoliang Demon Capital.

612
00:37:06,800 --> 00:37:07,980
But if you marry an immortal

613
00:37:08,030 --> 00:37:08,860
and make him your consort,

614
00:37:09,630 --> 00:37:11,050
won't your people be even more scared?

615
00:37:11,590 --> 00:37:12,050
Of course not.

616
00:37:12,150 --> 00:37:13,740
Shen Wangyan doesn't hate demons.

617
00:37:13,920 --> 00:37:15,050
If he can be so gentle with me,

618
00:37:15,110 --> 00:37:15,940
he can surely treat them

619
00:37:15,940 --> 00:37:16,590
just as kindly.

620
00:37:16,670 --> 00:37:17,530
Compared to him,

621
00:37:17,590 --> 00:37:18,740
they're much more afraid of me.

622
00:37:25,710 --> 00:37:26,490
Why are they

623
00:37:26,510 --> 00:37:27,210
so scared of you?

624
00:37:27,840 --> 00:37:28,530
What exactly

625
00:37:28,960 --> 00:37:29,780
is your true form?

626
00:37:36,110 --> 00:37:37,210
Anyway, whatever it takes.

627
00:37:37,960 --> 00:37:38,980
As long as you help me

628
00:37:39,030 --> 00:37:40,010
marry Shen Wangyan,

629
00:37:40,480 --> 00:37:42,130
I'll use the talisman to send you back.

630
00:37:42,510 --> 00:37:44,530
The question is, can you pull it off?

631
00:37:44,760 --> 00:37:45,530
Of course.

632
00:37:50,070 --> 00:37:50,740
I

633
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,180
know how to handle men.

634
00:37:53,340 --> 00:37:54,490
There's not a man alive

635
00:37:55,000 --> 00:37:56,740
who can resist my charms.

636
00:38:18,070 --> 00:38:19,050
Master is safe now.

637
00:38:19,840 --> 00:38:21,210
I just have to wait for him to wake up.

638
00:38:36,190 --> 00:38:37,570
Where could Qi Fengyin

639
00:38:38,280 --> 00:38:39,380
have gone after escaping

640
00:38:39,440 --> 00:38:40,130
the treasure chamber?

641
00:38:41,110 --> 00:38:42,820
The Wanjun Lock is incredibly powerful.

642
00:38:43,710 --> 00:38:44,860
Can he really keep it under control?

643
00:38:49,820 --> 00:38:54,220
[Huanxia Pavilion]

644
00:39:00,550 --> 00:39:01,570
At this time of year,

645
00:39:02,190 --> 00:39:03,860
the Wish Tree should appear soon.

646
00:39:04,630 --> 00:39:05,740
If I want to get the talisman back,

647
00:39:06,590 --> 00:39:07,690
I'll have to help win

648
00:39:08,030 --> 00:39:09,650
Shen Wangyan's heart before then.

649
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:13,810
I wonder if Youyou in the present

650
00:39:13,810 --> 00:39:14,690
can hold on that long.

651
00:39:18,880 --> 00:39:19,820
This is going to be tough.

652
00:39:37,840 --> 00:39:38,860
You already escaped.

653
00:39:39,230 --> 00:39:40,130
Why did you come back?

654
00:39:41,000 --> 00:39:42,130
Youyou is a mighty demon now.

655
00:39:42,360 --> 00:39:42,980
There's no bond

656
00:39:43,000 --> 00:39:43,900
between us at all.

657
00:39:44,400 --> 00:39:45,050
Knowing her,

658
00:39:45,440 --> 00:39:46,130
she could decide

659
00:39:46,150 --> 00:39:46,860
to kill you at any moment.

660
00:39:47,320 --> 00:39:48,740
How could I let you die in my place?

661
00:39:51,960 --> 00:39:53,460
You came back because you were worried about me?

662
00:40:01,590 --> 00:40:03,340
I thought once you saw your master,

663
00:40:04,230 --> 00:40:05,460
you'd stay in Luoshen Valley

664
00:40:05,960 --> 00:40:06,860
and never want to come back.

665
00:40:07,360 --> 00:40:08,610
So which is it?

666
00:40:08,670 --> 00:40:09,900
Did you want me to come back

667
00:40:10,230 --> 00:40:11,530
or not?

668
00:40:14,280 --> 00:40:15,120
Whatever you do,

669
00:40:15,120 --> 00:40:16,420
you always manage to upset me.

670
00:40:18,710 --> 00:40:20,340
So I should've minded my own business?

671
00:40:20,760 --> 00:40:22,260
Someone's clearly powerful enough

672
00:40:22,510 --> 00:40:23,840
to get by without my help.

673
00:40:23,920 --> 00:40:25,610
Fine. I'll stay far away from you

674
00:40:25,800 --> 00:40:26,610
so I won't upset you again.

675
00:40:40,960 --> 00:40:42,900
I know you were worried about me, too.

676
00:40:43,960 --> 00:40:44,880
You never say what you really mean.

677
00:40:44,880 --> 00:40:45,740
But I won't hold it against you.

678
00:40:46,190 --> 00:40:48,380
Can we stop arguing, please?

679
00:40:51,480 --> 00:40:52,940
I made a deal with Youyou.

680
00:40:53,400 --> 00:40:55,340
If I help her win over the man she loves

681
00:40:55,360 --> 00:40:55,940
and marry him,

682
00:40:56,230 --> 00:40:57,490
she'll lend us the talisman

683
00:40:57,490 --> 00:40:58,210
to send us back.

684
00:40:59,460 --> 00:41:01,940
But you know

685
00:41:02,440 --> 00:41:04,170
I can't always rely on my powers.

686
00:41:04,550 --> 00:41:05,980
They work one moment and fail the next.

687
00:41:06,590 --> 00:41:07,650
So...

688
00:41:08,590 --> 00:41:10,180
I needed someone powerful on my side.

689
00:41:12,590 --> 00:41:14,010
And you made me your protector?

690
00:41:14,280 --> 00:41:15,980
Well, Youyou's afraid of you.

691
00:41:16,800 --> 00:41:17,570
So...

692
00:41:17,920 --> 00:41:19,980
I may have made our relationship

693
00:41:20,280 --> 00:41:23,340
sound just a little more romantic.

694
00:41:26,280 --> 00:41:27,900
I told her...

695
00:41:29,110 --> 00:41:32,740
I said you were...

696
00:41:35,320 --> 00:41:36,170
wrapped around my little finger.

697
00:41:38,030 --> 00:41:39,340
What does that mean?

698
00:41:43,910 --> 00:41:44,740
It means

699
00:41:45,800 --> 00:41:47,130
you can't resist my charms

700
00:41:47,430 --> 00:41:48,490
and you're madly in love

701
00:41:49,280 --> 00:41:49,780
with me.

702
00:41:56,400 --> 00:41:57,260
Then tell me,

703
00:41:58,400 --> 00:41:59,130
how should I play along?

704
00:42:01,440 --> 00:42:02,340
Well...

705
00:42:05,760 --> 00:42:06,820
Like those inner disciples

706
00:42:06,880 --> 00:42:07,740
around Su Hexiang?

707
00:42:08,630 --> 00:42:09,530
Always flattering her?

708
00:42:11,190 --> 00:42:12,260
Or perhaps

709
00:42:12,920 --> 00:42:14,980
I should come running whenever you call,

710
00:42:15,510 --> 00:42:16,650
ready to live or die for you?

711
00:42:16,840 --> 00:42:17,910
Or we could do what we did last time,

712
00:42:17,910 --> 00:42:19,100
put on an act for Yuwen Hao,

713
00:42:19,100 --> 00:42:20,530
and fool them the same way?

714
00:42:20,550 --> 00:42:21,010
I...

715
00:42:25,230 --> 00:42:26,460
Don't fall. Go on.

716
00:42:35,110 --> 00:42:35,900
What are you staring at?

717
00:42:38,560 --> 00:42:39,360
Master!

718
00:42:52,720 --> 00:42:53,810
I know you love sweets,

719
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:54,780
so I bought these just for you.

720
00:42:55,190 --> 00:42:57,050
After all, we're the best of friends.

721
00:42:58,070 --> 00:42:59,460
Never celebrated New Year's Eve.

722
00:43:00,070 --> 00:43:00,980
Never even seen snow.

723
00:43:02,230 --> 00:43:03,690
[Moonwatch Tower]
Qi Fengyin, come see the snow!

724
00:43:42,940 --> 00:43:48,700
♪Life and death find no harbor in your cloudy eyes♪

725
00:43:50,180 --> 00:43:55,820
♪Words across a thousand years gently caress the abyss♪

726
00:43:56,460 --> 00:44:03,340
♪One thought sows karma. Who knows right from wrong? Love entwines the stars♪

727
00:44:03,460 --> 00:44:09,380
♪We cross paths through lifetimes, rekindling the sparks of time♪

728
00:44:10,900 --> 00:44:16,540
♪In this fleeting, haunted life, good and evil blur, ensnaring you and me♪

729
00:44:18,220 --> 00:44:23,900
♪Love rides the waves, cleaving a path through this vast world♪

730
00:44:24,220 --> 00:44:28,660
♪Dawn and dusk gain color at our fingertips♪

731
00:44:28,780 --> 00:44:31,740
♪Our vows live on in ink♪

732
00:44:31,860 --> 00:44:37,580
♪No matter what storms may rise behind us♪

733
00:44:38,420 --> 00:44:40,860
♪One day, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

734
00:44:40,860 --> 00:44:45,460
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

735
00:44:45,460 --> 00:44:47,820
♪Sleepless through bloodshed and strife♪

736
00:44:47,820 --> 00:44:52,020
♪We pray our love will remain unbroken♪

737
00:44:52,260 --> 00:44:54,540
♪Across vast mountains and rivers♪

738
00:44:54,540 --> 00:44:56,340
♪How lucky we are to have found each other♪

739
00:44:56,340 --> 00:44:59,260
♪Together, we'll walk through time's depths and shallows♪

740
00:44:59,260 --> 00:45:01,420
♪Before all splendor fades♪

741
00:45:01,420 --> 00:45:06,060
♪With no regrets, we etch a lifetime of devotion♪

742
00:45:06,580 --> 00:45:08,980
♪In this life, wild blossoms fill our dreams♪

743
00:45:09,020 --> 00:45:13,620
♪Two hearts entwined, a secret vow binds us in life and death♪

744
00:45:13,620 --> 00:45:15,980
♪We cannot escape the wind and snow♪

745
